In order to compile this game you need a Pascal compiler. The Free Pascal 
Compiler works: http://freepascal.org/ 

Your GNU/Linux distro may already have it packaged. In the Trisquel GNU/Linux 
distro for example: sudo apt-get install fpc

To compile it then run:
fpc src/BEYOND.PAS

The binary will be named BEYOND and stored in the src directory.

